00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:10.840
Next question, John asks:

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:17.500
"Does Melissandre see something special in Jon Snow? She's been eyeing him up ever since they set foot on Castle Black."

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.974
