00:07:29.693 --> 00:07:34.893
Most of you guys probably know that I'm a big fan of the R+L=J theory of Jon Snow.

00:07:34.893 --> 00:07:37.959
As in, like, his parents are Rhaegar Targaryen and Lyanna Stark.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:41.280
